MinerU attribution (required -- do not remove)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

When the MinerU engine is enabled, document parsing in DeepDocParse is powered
by MinerU (https://github.com/opendatalab/MinerU). Native CPU parsing paths do
not call MinerU.

MinerU adds terms on top of Apache-2.0. Section 2 requires that any product
providing an online service built on MinerU state clearly and prominently, in
the product UI or in public documentation, that it uses MinerU; section 3
terminates the license automatically -- without notice -- on violation.
Deployments using MinerU are such services. This attribution is retained in:

  - this NOTICE file
  - README.md, at the top of the page
  - the apps/web product UI, in a footer shown on every page

