Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Model runtimes such as MinerU and DeepSeek-OCR are accessed over HTTP. Native
CPU parsing runs in process using PDFium and, for ruled tables, pdfplumber.
Component availability depends on deployment; each component retains its own
license and bundled dependency notices.

